# Telegram scraper credentials — OPTIONAL.
# Only needed if you use the "Telegram scrape" tab to fill the library.
# The compositor (import, effects, preview, render) never reads this file.
#
# Get API credentials at https://my.telegram.org -> API development tools.
# Copy this file to `.env` and fill in the values.

TG_API_ID=
TG_API_HASH=
TG_PHONE=
# A Telethon session file is created on first auth; keep it out of version control.
